1104 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I am a web developer with a solid foundation in both front\055end and back\055end development\056 Throughout my experience\054 I have worked with different teams and taken on a variety of roles\054 which has allowed me to contribute across multiple stages of the product lifecycle\054 from discovery and design to implementation and release\056\nCurrently\054 I am expanding my knowledge in DevOps and infrastructure\054 with a focus on AWS\056\nMy goal is to develop the ability to work across the entire system\054 from the user interface to the underlying infrastructure\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1105 0 R
     /Pg 1098 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

