1108 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I have worked on several projects\054 both internal and external to the company\056\nOn external projects\054 I have mainly worked as a front\055end developer in teams of 4 to 7 people\054 using modern open\055source technologies such as Vue\056js\054 Nuxt\054 Tailwind CSS\054 Headless UI\054 pnpm workspaces\054 and Vite\056\n\nI am currently working as a full\055stack engineer at Paytient Technologies\054 using React\054 Redux\054 Jest\054 and related technologies on the front end\054 and Java\054 Groovy\054 PostgreSQL\054 and related technologies on the back end\056\n\nOn internal projects\054 I create and take part in training initiatives\054 teaching beginner and intermediate web development classes\056 These courses focus on helping people quickly learn the technologies required for specific projects\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 1109 0 R
     /Pg 1098 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

